  "summary": "Oracle Certified Professional (Java SE 17) & Software Engineer @ Visa\n\nI am a detail-oriented Software Engineer with a focus on building high-availability, scalable systems. Currently at Visa, I contribute to the evolution of global financial technologies, spanning from robust back-end microservices to high-performance Android and iOS mobile engineering.\n\nMy technical expertise is rooted in the Java ecosystem, where I hold an Oracle OCP SE 17 certification. I have a proven track record of designing systems that handle 100,000+ concurrent users and optimizing CI/CD pipelines to accelerate deployment cycles by up to 40%.\n\nCore Technical Competencies:\n\nLanguages: Java (Expert), Swift (iOS), Kotlin/Java (Android), JavaScript (MERN).\n\nBack-end: Spring Boot, Hibernate, Microservices, REST APIs.\n\nMobile: Native iOS and Android development for enterprise-scale applications.\n\nCloud & DevOps: AWS (EC2, ECS), Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments where I can apply my expertise in the full software development lifecycle to solve complex, real-world problems.\n\nLet’s connect: stacyjones12335@gmail.com",
