    "title": "Soil Search – IoT Agricultural Monitoring System",
    "description": "Hackabull 2025 Hackathon Project\n\nEngineered an end-to-end IoT monitoring solution designed to make precision farming accessible to non-technical users. The system streams real-time moisture data from hardware sensors to a web dashboard.\n\nReal-Time Data Pipeline: Built a full-stack MERN application (MongoDB, Express, React, Node) connecting Arduino soil sensors to a cloud interface, eliminating the need for manual field testing.\n\nPerformance Optimization: Optimized MongoDB schemas to handle high-frequency time-series data, ensuring low-latency retrieval for live sensor feeds.\n\nImpactful UI: Developed a responsive React dashboard that transforms raw complex sensor readings into clear, actionable visual insights for crop health.\n\nTech Stack: JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, Arduino Hardware Integration, REST APIs.",
